<h3>Managing Tolls and Checkposts</h3>
<p>The Hyderabad-Nellore corridor includes several national highway toll plazas. Ensure your FASTag is active and has sufficient balance. Manual toll payments are slower and prone to errors. Additionally, be prepared for police checkposts that verify vehicle fitness and cargo manifests. Delays here are common if your cargo value declarations do not match the transport documents.</div></div>

<h3>Common Pitfalls to Avoid</h3>
